<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">

    <title>Our Story</title>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('templates/navBar.ejs'); -%>

    <div class="head">
        <img src="" width="200" height="100" alt="Photo">
        <h2>Crafted With Passion</h2>
        <p>We believe great food is not just cooked, It's cooked with care, culture and consistency </p>
    </div>

    <div class="story">
        <h2>Our Story</h2>
        <p>This place started with hunger, curiosity, and a refusal to settle 
            for forgettable food. We cook with real ingredients, a lot of patience, and just enough stubbornness to get things right. Our menu blends familiar flavors with small surprises, made for sharing stories, not just meals. Come hungry. Leave happy. That's the whole idea.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="feature">
        <span class="title">Quality Ingredients</span>
        <span class="description">Fresh, carefully sourced, and treated with respect. No shortcuts, no sad produce.</span>
    </div>

    <div class="team">
        <h2>Meet The Team</h2>

        <img src="" width="100" height="100" alt="Team-Photo">
        <span class="team-name">Head chef</span>
        <span class="team-description">10+ years of culinary experience </span>
    </div>
   
</body>
</html>





